meta {
  name: core-api
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Incident and uptime monitor API. Base URL `{{coreApiUrl}}`, prefix `/api/v1`. Every route requires a bearer access token.

  Roles:

  | Action              | viewer | operator | admin |
  |---------------------|--------|----------|-------|
  | list / get          | yes    | yes      | yes   |
  | create / update     |        | yes      | yes   |
| pause / resume      |        | yes      | yes   |
  | delete              |        |          | yes   |
  | websocket           | yes    | yes      | yes   |
}
